  <jpcrp_cor:InformationForEachProductOrServiceTextBlock contextRef="CurrentYearDuration_NonConsolidatedMember">&lt;p class="smt_text6" style="orphans:0;widows:0;"&gt;１．製品及びサービスごとの情報&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text2" style="orphans:0;widows:0;"&gt;セグメント情報に同様の情報を開示しているため、記載を省略しています。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text2" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:9pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-indent:9pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:15pt;font-size:15pt;"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text6" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:0pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:5pt;font-size:5pt;"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;</jpcrp_cor:InformationForEachProductOrServiceTextBlock>
  <jpcrp_cor:RevenuesFromExternalCustomersInformationForEachRegionTextBlock contextRef="CurrentYearDuration_NonConsolidatedMember">&lt;p class="smt_text6" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:9pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:15pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;(1) 売上高&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text6" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:9pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:15pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;　  本邦の外部顧客への売上高が損益計算書の売上高の90％を超えるため、記載を省略しています。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text6" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:0pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:8pt;font-size:8pt;"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;</jpcrp_cor:RevenuesFromExternalCustomersInformationForEachRegionTextBlock>
  <jpcrp_cor:PropertyPlantAndEquipmentInformationForEachRegionTextBlock contextRef="CurrentYearDuration_NonConsolidatedMember">&lt;p class="smt_text6" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:9pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:15pt;"&gt;(2) 有形固定資産&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text3" style="orphans:0;widows:0;"&gt;本邦以外に所在している有形固定資産が無いため、該当事項はありません。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text6" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:0pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:5pt;font-size:5pt;"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;</jpcrp_cor:PropertyPlantAndEquipmentInformationForEachRegionTextBlock>
  <jpcrp_cor:InformationForEachOfMainCustomersTextBlock contextRef="CurrentYearDuration_NonConsolidatedMember">&lt;p class="smt_text6" style="orphans:0;widows:0;"&gt;３．主要な顧客ごとの情報&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text6" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:right;padding-left:0pt;padding-right:9pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:10pt;"&gt;(単位：千円)&lt;/p&gt;
